of the chamber and doesn't have a legislative agenda, and that's why the government have listed barely any sitting days. It's absolutely shameless. We are seeking support from the chamber for the chamber to do its job: to sit and consider legislation and debate it. We've just seen a gag rammed through where we couldn't debate anything. We want some more sitting days so we can do our job: anticorruption legislation and the Jenkins recommendations. Let's do our job.*","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-7565","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2021-12-01/21"}
